    ["1. 语音房间最多可容纳1000人。\n2. 心动信号语音房间默认是房主设置发言顺序模式，需点击开麦按钮发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可开麦。\n3. 麦序上的玩家自动获得嘉宾身份，1麦玩家为座上宾身份，语音房间内的所有嘉宾均可通过切换爆灯状态来表达情绪。通过房间右上角实况界面可更直观的查看当前所有嘉宾的发言和爆灯情况。\n4. 房主可在成员权限设置处调整发言顺序，设置禁言和房间黑名单，也可在右侧侧边栏设置界面，调整房间信息、进行常驻房间续时、转让房主操作。\n5. 在右侧侧边框可分享语音房间链接、发放语音房间礼金。"] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Heartbeat Signal voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. Players on the mic Последовательность automatically gain Guest status; the player on mic #1 is the Guest of Honor. All guests in the voice room can express emotions by switching their \"Light Up\" status. You can view the current speech and \"Light Up\" status of all guests more intuitively via the live interface in the top right corner. \n 4. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 5. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
